<section class="hs-hero"><div class="hs-tri"><div class="hs-tri-c" style="--d:0"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1778991055808-17d0edf30e3c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=1100&q=75" alt="a woman in a pink blazer and patterned tights" width="620" height="1100" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="hs-tri-c" style="--d:1"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581626376785-9ba6834f3d4a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=1100&q=75" alt="a woman in a purple coat and black skirt standing outdoors" width="620" height="1100" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="hs-tri-c" style="--d:2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1767249633198-adc9b328d47f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=620&h=1100&q=75" alt="a woman in a red outfit and sunglasses posing" width="620" height="1100" fetchpriority="high"></div></div><div class="hs-hero-t"><p class="hs-ey">The legwear maison</p><h1>Hosiery</h1><p class="hs-hero-p"><em>An independent guide to tights: denier, fit, colour and care, for legs that look finished in every season.</em></p><a class="hs-btn" href="#denier">Explore the denier scale</a></div></section>

<section class="hs-s hs-in"><div class="hs-w"><p class="hs-big rv">The right pair of tights changes an outfit as much as the shoes do. <em>Sheer</em> reads elegant, <em>opaque</em> reads modern, and colour changes everything.</p><div class="hs-in-n stg"><div class="rv"><b data-count="15">15</b><span>denier: the classic sheer</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="40">40</b><span>denier: semi-opaque, everyday</span></div><div class="rv"><b data-count="80">80</b><span>denier: opaque and warm</span></div></div></div></section>

<section class="hs-s hs-dn" id="denier"><div class="hs-w hs-dn-g"><div class="hs-dn-v"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 420" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="sk" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#C99B7E"/><stop offset=".5" stop-color="#E5C2A8"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#BE8E72"/></linearGradient><pattern id="kn" width="4" height="4" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M0 2h4" stroke="#000" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width=".6"/></pattern></defs><path d="M110 10h80l-6 260q-2 60 20 100l20 34h-80l-20-40q-18-40-20-94z" fill="url(#sk)"/><path id="dn-l" d="M110 10h80l-6 260q-2 60 20 100l20 34h-80l-20-40q-18-40-20-94z" fill="#121012"/><path d="M110 10h80l-6 260q-2 60 20 100l20 34h-80l-20-40q-18-40-20-94z" fill="url(#kn)" id="dn-k"/></svg></div><div><p class="hs-ey">The denier scale</p><h2 class="rv">From whisper-sheer to fully opaque</h2><p class="hs-p">Denier measures the weight of the yarn. Slide to see how sheer each weight looks, and when to wear it.</p><label class="hs-lab" for="dn-s">Denier <output id="dn-o">40</output><input type="range" id="dn-s" min="0" max="7" value="3"></label><div class="hs-cols" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Colour"><label><input type="radio" name="dc" value="#121012" checked><span style="background:#121012" title="Black"></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="dc" value="#5A4A3E"><span style="background:#5A4A3E" title="Chocolate"></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="dc" value="#2D3550"><span style="background:#2D3550" title="Navy"></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="dc" value="#6B2238"><span style="background:#6B2238" title="Berry"></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="dc" value="#C9A58A"><span style="background:#C9A58A" title="Nude"></span></label></div><div class="hs-dn-o" id="dn-r" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div></section>

<section class="hs-lb"><div class="hs-lb-w"><div class="hs-lb-s on" data-i="0"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615898290907-0ad011905389?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=75" alt="a woman in a black blazer with a short skirt and black tights" width="1400" height="900" loading="lazy"><div class="hs-lb-t"><span>Look 01</span><h3>Office, opaque</h3><p>60 denier black with a tailored blazer: polished and warm.</p></div></div><div class="hs-lb-s" data-i="1"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1764016888026-9824147644af?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=75" alt="a woman in a plaid vest and black coat" width="1400" height="900" loading="lazy"><div class="hs-lb-t"><span>Look 02</span><h3>Weekend, texture</h3><p>Opaque tights under a check vest and wool coat.</p></div></div><div class="hs-lb-s" data-i="2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1777028724886-8254a593e5ed?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=75" alt="a woman in a pink tweed outfit and purple boots" width="1400" height="900" loading="lazy"><div class="hs-lb-t"><span>Look 03</span><h3>Colour, tonal</h3><p>Coloured tights that echo the boots lengthen the leg.</p></div></div><div class="hs-lb-s" data-i="3"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581365380561-840f964d9362?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=75" alt="a woman in a blue blazer and black skirt" width="1400" height="900" loading="lazy"><div class="hs-lb-t"><span>Look 04</span><h3>Classic, sheer</h3><p>Sheer 15 denier black: the evening classic.</p></div></div><div class="hs-lb-s" data-i="4"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1733902331277-ff7783027516?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&h=900&q=75" alt="a woman in a red dress walking down a street" width="1400" height="900" loading="lazy"><div class="hs-lb-t"><span>Look 05</span><h3>Bold, contrast</h3><p>Black tights against a bright dress make the colour sing.</p></div></div></div><div class="hs-w hs-lb-n"><p class="hs-ey">The lookbook</p><div class="hs-lb-ths"><button type="button" class="hs-lb-th on" data-i="0" aria-label="Show look 1">01</button><button type="button" class="hs-lb-th" data-i="1" aria-label="Show look 2">02</button><button type="button" class="hs-lb-th" data-i="2" aria-label="Show look 3">03</button><button type="button" class="hs-lb-th" data-i="3" aria-label="Show look 4">04</button><button type="button" class="hs-lb-th" data-i="4" aria-label="Show look 5">05</button></div><div class="hs-lb-bar"><i id="lb-bar"></i></div></div></section>

<section class="hs-s hs-sz" id="size"><div class="hs-w hs-sz-g"><div><p class="hs-ey">Size finder</p><h2 class="rv">Find your size</h2><p class="hs-p">Most tights are sized by height and weight together. Move both sliders to find the size most brands would suggest.</p><label class="hs-lab" for="sz-h">Height <output id="sz-ho">165 cm</output><input type="range" id="sz-h" min="150" max="190" value="165"></label><label class="hs-lab" for="sz-w">Weight <output id="sz-wo">60 kg</output><input type="range" id="sz-w" min="40" max="110" value="60"></label></div><div class="hs-sz-o"><div class="hs-sz-grid" id="sz-g" aria-hidden="true"></div><p id="sz-o" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div></section>

<section class="hs-s hs-cr"><div class="hs-w"><div class="hs-cen"><p class="hs-ey">Care in four steps</p><h2 class="rv">Make every pair last longer</h2></div><ol class="hs-cr-l stg"><li class="rv"><b>01</b><h3>Before wearing</h3><p>Remove rings and roll each leg down to the toe, then ease it on.</p></li><li class="rv"><b>02</b><h3>Washing</h3><p>Hand wash cool, or use a mesh bag on a delicate cycle.</p></li><li class="rv"><b>03</b><h3>Drying</h3><p>Dry flat or hang by the waistband, away from heat.</p></li><li class="rv"><b>04</b><h3>Storing</h3><p>Fold loosely in a soft pouch so nothing snags the yarn.</p></li></ol></div></section>

<section class="hs-gl"><a class="hs-gl-a" href="denier-guide.html"><div class="hs-gl-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1763467941375-3d8a4f16e6c2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=1100&q=75" alt="legs in patterned tights resting on a chair" width="900" height="1100" loading="lazy"></div><span>Guide one</span><b>Denier Explained</b></a><a class="hs-gl-a" href="tights-care-guide.html"><div class="hs-gl-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773520945721-f301352c1ab4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&h=1100&q=75" alt="legs in white tights and ballet flats" width="900" height="1100" loading="lazy"></div><span>Guide two</span><b>Tights Care &amp; Fit</b></a></section>

